 "words": 249,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "From Gilgal we walked side by side",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Elijah said stay here, I must go",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I swore I would not leave his side",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As surely as the Lord lives, no",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Give me a double portion of your spirit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before you are taken from my sight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If I see you go, it shall be given",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If not, then let me be in the night",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At Bethel the prophets asked me then",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you know he is being taken away?",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I said yes, I know, be still, my friend",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And we kept walking through the day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Give me a double portion of your spirit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before you are taken from my sight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If I see you go, it shall be given",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If not, then let me be in the night",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At the Jordan river bank we stood",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fifty prophets watched us from afar",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He rolled up his cloak, striking the flood",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The water parted on the dry ground star",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Give me a double portion of your spirit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before you are taken from my sight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If I see you go, it shall be given",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If not, then let me be in the night",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A chariot of fire split the sky",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Horses of flame and a whirlwind sound",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Elijah rose up, I cried and I sighed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My father, the chariots of this ground",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I took his cloak and struck the water",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Jordan split to the right and left",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The spirit of Elijah is the answer",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
